  "display_title": "A Lady's Risqué Hobby",
  "description": "Eileen Hamilton’s brother, Stephan, is at a loss to find her a match. No suitor can overcome her love of reading or insistence on marrying for love. But Eileen has a secret—she’s an author of erotic romances, and finding a cure for her inexperience and chronic writer’s block is far more pressing than her prospects. Certain everything is ruined when her secret is revealed to her brother's friend Alexander, she’s shocked when he offers to help. How could she refuse her crush?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
